// R2 Phase-5 wire (2026-05-16): chat_lib.hexa is the pure-fn lib half of
// anima_chat.hexa (R1 lib-split). Importing it here makes the VERIFIED 24L
// all-farr forward (Section 9c) + KV-cache decode (Section 9d) callable from
// HEXAD/D. Compiled codegen needs the explicit import (interp resolved
// cross-module implicitly); requires a hexa.real bootstrapped from
// hexa-lang ≥ 0fccac5c (PR #51 nested-index-assign codegen + PR #49/#50 decls).
import "/Users/ghost/core/anima/HEXAD/CHAT/chat_lib.hexa"


